CLEAN-ROOM NOTICE
This is a clean-room implementation written from a description of the Facebook
GraphQL protocol behavior (endpoints, document ids, request/response field paths,
and pagination semantics) — facts of interoperability, not copyrightable
expression. It contains no code copied from, and is not a derivative work of, any
third-party "educational only" / no-license repository. Prior open experimentation
was used only as inspiration and as test fixtures.

Before any public distribution (including publishing an Apify Store actor), replace
this placeholder with the final chosen license and resolve the commercial, Meta
Terms-of-Service, and data-protection (GDPR / personal data) items documented in
